    {
      "id": "f43aec91-79b4-4e7b-b97d-be7cc4e3901c",
      "title": "Passe pelos três cartões, escute o áudio e ligue cada forma ao ponto de vista certo.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "9d695170-7992-489c-bd21-5d7cbe6cd28e",
          "textContent": "<p>Cartão 1</p><p><strong>Somos sociables.</strong></p><p>A pessoa que fala está dentro do grupo.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b6eb8a54848f4da886233de4ae647db4_b07-somos-sociables.mp3?Expires=1794099418&Signature=BUS6MspgHXn87tLffE8Oj0wYqTGXSGNG20K9teLkN97fcdHbrxS6zbWilZzgvSc0LIURE0RN-uYX6Tu76IRPnCETFoVILQ1yp-SHj5XhLfIqEjI~mjfQW9USvqses0zgpXDHwrJLRBjFWvkDC12X4Xk3Hjp-d4kmuOgK68aH8QRZv6K6mmb~NxPw72mn8gqWCHwOwVxpfUJhnaK~i-Msk6hAt5jqo2y9wR8qKeHhvu~55ZOE2GVBE58fVjmpnluyfp5zHbipfIYnxxJH3mBspYbXddHcUdCFXxlAGZ5kTBJVTl7KHwTtfzAypQG4C8BPxcSL7675L4JhM50tvLp8bA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "7903f4ce-4d2b-4948-b7b8-9dbadb20a7b0",
          "textContent": "<p>Cartão 2</p><p><strong>Sois simpáticos.</strong></p><p>A pessoa que fala está diante do grupo.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/a70ea7a3e26a4ec496e0b5310e711bfe_A1_M005_L02_audio_e617f1b7_b07-sois-simpaticos.mp3?Expires=1794099418&Signature=d7clGtqCpCfj0HmoS4fRgTb~45-2KRnHx1UAviUcsw~h1ILRylogEfaCFv9KwmDR0qPChuEqtP7192q3H~zxbpeIFiUEBtZWWeUe3ZeYlrHfPbCTknUmLPLIr9NROvFggF2GHFT7B-ZGGQK6A8Yi1gp4S1PZk1FymgbQjaslFuK7y~BXVCoJVepKgtyOT19d0fuBKkYbcDpX1TowLv2UYRG4PdLslBCk~g84dcIYdpTLUC3kw-7HRz9P87YsRrfK1ljqXdD~1dFlTlOTB8Ka6QG91239wA-lFMgvr59yF3Mh06yeqk3ZYd9EQ4E0kSsyKO6mrC5aBGtCmdRbFjpuYg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "7b6b8701-ecce-4cdb-aa0e-d62e740176aa",
          "textContent": "<p>Cartão 3</p><p><strong>Son serios.</strong></p><p>A pessoa que fala observa outro grupo de fora.</p>",
